  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Enhanced Process Efficiency with Hugging Face AI",
    "splashDescription": "Transform Camunda-based business processes and operationalize AI/ML with Hugging Face, known of its cutting-edge natural language processing models. Hugging Face is a leading AI platform that provides a wide range of pre-trained models and tools for natural language processing, including transformers that excel in understanding and generating text. This blueprint empowers your business processes with intelligent routing, enabling more accurate and efficient decision-making.",
